powah.ponder.shared.charging.1=Use a Binding Card in the air, then insert it into a powered Player Transmitter.
powah.ponder.shared.charging.2=Ordinary cards work in the same dimension. Upgrade the card using an Enderman for other dimensions.
powah.ponder.shared.charging.3=Energy Hoppers charge container items; Dischargers extract energy. Sneak-use Batteries to enable portable charging.
powah.ponder.shared.ender.1=Ender Cells and Gates share energy across dimensions when owner and channel match.
powah.ponder.shared.ender.2=Open an Ender Cell and Shift-click an Energy Cell or Battery in your inventory. It is consumed to add its capacity and stored energy to the channel.
powah.ponder.shared.ender.3=Set an Ender Gate to the same channel. Its attached face provides wireless power.
powah.ponder.shared.energizing.1=Insert one item at a time into the Energizing Orb. Iron and gold make two Energized Steel.
powah.ponder.shared.energizing.2=Power an Energizing Rod through its attached face. It automatically finds an orb within four blocks.
powah.ponder.shared.energizing.3=Several rods can charge one recipe. Extract the output before inserting the next recipe.
powah.ponder.shared.power.1=Feed furnace fuel into a Furnator to generate Forge Energy.
powah.ponder.shared.power.2=Connect a generator to an Energy Cell using Energy Cables. The slowest cable limits the route.
powah.ponder.shared.power.3=Solar Panels need daylight; Thermo Generators need water and heat below. Magmators consume lava.
powah.ponder.shared.reactor.1=Place 36 matching parts in a clear 3 x 4 x 3 space to assemble a Reactor.
powah.ponder.shared.reactor.2=Insert Uraninite. Coal and redstone improve efficiency; water and solid coolant lower temperature.
powah.ponder.shared.reactor.3=Output at bottom, lower side centers or top center. Removing a part refunds all 36 parts.
